    "jacobian_conclusion": "Every exact fixed-order point found over F_5 and F_7 has formal Jacobian rank 6, so the six-equation locus is smooth of dimension 2 at each of those points.",
    "next_use": "Use a smooth F_7 point as a Hensel seed, fix two transverse parameters, lift the remaining six variables p-adically, and test rational reconstruction before imposing the rank-one section glue.",
